  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Department of Energy, Comprehensive Nuclear-Test-Ban Treaty (CTBT) Monitoring and Verification System Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The funding supports U.S. experts to serve as Working Group B (WGB) Task Leaders and Expert Group Chair during biannual Comprehensive Nuclear-Test-Ban Treaty (CTBT) WGB technical meetings in Vienna, Austria focused on international nuclear explosion monitoring issues.</narrative>
